4. New symbols needed: name : sort : required-JSON-fields, …
5. Planned assertions: (assert (<LOGICAL-EXPRESSION>)) ; "#REQUIREMENT#"
6. Redeclaration check: pass / fail
7. Undeclared-usage check: pass / fail
</think>


